    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "1f2b60bb-f5fb-469e-9ba7-6cd6c1eab611",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Workplace Bully? Not for me! 职场霸凌应对守则",
        "Location": "LOCATION_EDGY_FOX",
        "PublicId": "129678927805",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c4cc4ef-3242-467a-9753-d998ad22a344).Image",
        "Description": "You&apos;ve always hated your colleagues. They are underbred, vicious and self-central all the time.\rThis day you get to know that they made up lies to your boss and made him fire you.\rYou can&apos;t believe how ruthless they could be, and how stupid your boss is to actually believe in that.\rNow is the time to show your &apos;respect&apos; to them, along with your stupid boss. Make them pay, boy.\r\r你一直都很讨厌你的同事们。他们自私、没教养，似乎生来就如此邪恶。\r一天，你得知了他们向你的老板编造你的丑闻，从而使得你被老板解雇。\r你难以相信他们是如此无情，也不敢相信你的老板竟然蠢到相信了他们的鬼话。\r现在，是时候让他们付出代价了",
        "GameVersion": "8.12.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_EDGY"
        ],
        "CreatorUserId": "b2490bdd-5174-4e39-ae98-c8af7f6c6e7b",
